  "metadata": {
    "description": "Share of households with no vehicle available, pale yellow through teal to navy. Measured over all 31,711 places with a published value: 6 classes with breaks at 0.5%/2.5%/5%/8.5%/14%, which fall at the 25th/40th/59th/77th/90th percentile of the national distribution. 60.43% of places have a coefficient of variation above 0.3 at this geography, too many to fade without washing the map out, so read pct_hh_no_vehicle_moe in the GeoParquet before drawing a conclusion from any single place.",
